direction: right
root: Existing RootTask adapter\nclosed source / stable worker selection
writer: Diagnostic tag producer\nsame selected worker as mark_array
copy: Actual copying worker\nVM section map + round destination
validator: validate_old_obj(work)
report: bug(work) -> explain_problem(work)\n-> dump_memory_map(work)
root -> writer -> copy -> validator -> report
carrier: Carrier adapter\nphysical allocation guards\nnot diagnostic authority
carrier -> root: existing public bridge retained
carrier -> report: labeled physical fields only
model: OpenSysML SDK -> ASCENT\nsource / native obligations\nQNT histories + Lean ranges reused
model -> validator: refinement obligations
proposals: Nine-file source review\n5 coordinate churn +2 unsafe reversions rejected\n1 diagnostic owner replaced /1 refusal still open
proposals -> model
history: Historical Evidence producer\n114 immutable references /3 real replays\nwrong era or missing source refuses
history -> model
open: Not admitted\nwhole debug VM /fatal cleanup /dead-owner recovery\ndefault compiler failures /whole SMP /stable speedup
report -> open: explicit scope
